  DisplayName: Close Combat
  Description: Deals more damage to nearby enemies. Damage falls off significantly against distant enemies. Supported Skills grant Combat Rush on HitCombat Rush lasts # seconds or until you use a Travel Skill Combat Rush grants #% more Attack Speed to Travel Skills not Supported by Close Combat Supported Skills can only be used with Axes or Swords
